00:22:31,467 --> 00:22:37,887
The most fearsome battle since the beginning of the Great Pirate Era brought victories and defeats alike,

256
00:22:37,887 --> 00:22:41,887
leaving the world uncertain of its future.

257
00:22:50,427 --> 00:23:14,887
The War of the Best has thrown the entire world into chaos.

258
00:23:14,887 --> 00:23:17,387
Emboldened by the final words of Whitebeard,

259
00:23:17,387 --> 00:23:21,387
the Pirates once again envision a way they can ride into a new era.

260
00:23:21,387 --> 00:23:24,187
However, in the vacuum left after his demise,

261
00:23:24,187 --> 00:23:26,827
the seas grow rougher than ever before.

262
00:23:26,827 --> 00:23:28,827
On the next, One Piece,

263
00:23:28,827 --> 00:23:31,227
mighty leaders face each other down,

264
00:23:31,227 --> 00:23:32,927
heralding the new era.

265
00:23:32,927 --> 00:23:35,247
I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!

